{"schema_version":1,"status":"complete","epoch":"zhcn-67f8551f7780","task_id":"batch-01246-s03","batch":1246,"shard":3,"source_commit":"67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835","source_queue_git_commit":"ba3815ed06a2a9bb3fddb38a6e1ea7ca64506da2","shard_start":60,"shard_end_exclusive":80,"translated_count":20,"worker_id":"gpt56sol-auto11-20260906T011300Z-translation","updated_at":"2026-09-06T01:21:00Z","entries":[{"entry_index":60,"uid":"zhcn:9ef0e14117920fcf4945d7e8","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"唔哇——比赛就快开始啦……\r\n但既然都来到这里了，\r\n就也只能好好面对咯——","source_fingerprint":"2e5be41516ff739ad6e2786b0b5a03262200a7bc1e8cc0b27b56462da2b50be8","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1020","20034"],"target_text":"U oa—— Race sắp bắt đầu rồi……\r\nNhưng đã đến tận đây,\r\nthì cũng chỉ còn cách nghiêm túc đối mặt thôi——","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":61,"uid":"zhcn:25e4f0b36251ea09bbb90fc8","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"反正也不是现在做点什么，\r\n就会有什么改变的嘛。\r\n我就照自己的步调去跑咯。","source_fingerprint":"cbbd4d90cffc40f3f433c90d43e5d54241aa9e65a2b63d4aa0cbcc6e65db822f","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1020","20035"],"target_text":"Đằng nào giờ có làm thêm gì\r\ncũng chẳng thay đổi được bao nhiêu.\r\nMình cứ chạy theo nhịp của mình thôi.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":62,"uid":"zhcn:9ded3d1b56f4e25c26a40546","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"呀～全都是看起来很强的对手啊——\r\n……但这时候要是我拿第一名，\r\n应该会非常有趣吧？","source_fingerprint":"c80b6bfdd5e794c9923f9182a96058d9f518540e46aaa6318b0e346a7fb12765","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1020","20036"],"target_text":"Chà～ toàn đối thủ trông mạnh cả——\r\n…… Nhưng nếu lúc này mình về nhất,\r\nchẳng phải sẽ thú vị lắm sao?","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":63,"uid":"zhcn:7c6c35a4f88c3f04f4779bf1","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"赢了是侥幸，\r\n输了也不意外——\r\n反正就是这种感觉啦——","source_fingerprint":"c94f989dce63673480b3e7ce65cd2269e438fe05763681b35d3ac6098123ee85","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1020","20037"],"target_text":"Thắng thì là may mắn,\r\nthua cũng chẳng có gì lạ——\r\nđại khái là vậy đó——","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":64,"uid":"zhcn:700e77503b4025547dffb2ee","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"好啦好啦——","source_fingerprint":"87331471ea174ed609328d3734d09672ad5f6cbbfe121e90863d9be860efd79a","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1020","20038"],"target_text":"Rồi rồi——","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":65,"uid":"zhcn:67282e439a107609839e1c50","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"好吧——","source_fingerprint":"6324edda6c0127822d0c6c7280df2195aac8d03a7209aca19cffadf07af136c2","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1020","20039"],"target_text":"Thôi được——","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":66,"uid":"zhcn:3a213ddae1f2b33b50df1ad8","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"OK——","source_fingerprint":"4bc4454c60512bed243b77f94b93c108f91cfff67c3ad2cc0c03423dc56ab9e7","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1020","20040"],"target_text":"OK——","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":67,"uid":"zhcn:f02130cfdd280f9153fc5934","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"念书啊——","source_fingerprint":"e6ef9449f6aad2b4ea6495c5a591e62e60067782cae36d356894619f60bee147","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1020","20041"],"target_text":"Học bài à——","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":68,"uid":"zhcn:3e44f2f014a71aea7b16da61","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"唔唔～嗯……","source_fingerprint":"76014ef2aeef544b738755476c882c6c6e25c9ddc35e8df33bc4304ac1f8509f","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1020","20042"],"target_text":"Ư ư～ ừm……","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":69,"uid":"zhcn:7110d1f619ddb0a4f8877d38","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"呼哇……","source_fingerprint":"6cec7a36e298493f1d75ff08e31f1d96512331979e25650ca56d116ea35db8da","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1020","20043"],"target_text":"Haa……","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":70,"uid":"zhcn:4bccf99e47fd686200bb71da","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"那就走吧——","source_fingerprint":"9f5c09f8dc755f5d8409da8172e0bea880adb1d819209045107155827320d638","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1020","20046"],"target_text":"Vậy đi thôi——","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":71,"uid":"zhcn:400492832cac00dd4d96dfe4","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"海边耶——！","source_fingerprint":"f8d8412fc0243b674c10b58990b44b61201e494aef4f8774946a9fee8bf2692a","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1020","20047"],"target_text":"Biển kìa——!","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":72,"uid":"zhcn:d2f11bcd09f9bbad5c00c4bf","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"呀——玩得真开心耶，训练员。","source_fingerprint":"fead768f5325c96350c1a419dcece927df1e759572114bcb1161c6b58dffe9d8","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1020","20049"],"target_text":"A—— chơi vui thật đấy, Trainer.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":73,"uid":"zhcn:2beb165cd1c2c79460a3ccf6","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"以我来说算是非常努力了吧？","source_fingerprint":"e94cbef8930838996495396bafc5d5e2239a90095a2db25b2a1294d2eb314f84","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1020","20050"],"target_text":"Với mình thì thế này đã là cố gắng lắm rồi nhỉ?","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":74,"uid":"zhcn:9baa931778ed2e96f26765f5","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"你好你好——请多指教哦。","source_fingerprint":"533ac0d4ed40b3ce461324eaa03e1860daee3ab092262e0205c64eca6716bb55","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1020","20051"],"target_text":"Xin chào, xin chào—— trông cậy vào cậu nhé.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":75,"uid":"zhcn:3407238008072da8b0ff046c","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"那我就去咯——","source_fingerprint":"e96441a321db55e3e5b8eb19cf1f36a61d6fc16261e9eb4346e00b1bdd3cd9e2","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1020","2030"],"target_text":"Vậy mình đi đây——","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":76,"uid":"zhcn:498e8f50e59aa0a063659b05","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"好了，各位，轮到我们上场咯！","source_fingerprint":"d5056dc3864ced4d551d248e211d3180b3fb65b1020bce9ed50503e9fac66d39","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1020","2031"],"target_text":"Nào mọi người, đến lượt chúng ta ra sân rồi!","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":77,"uid":"zhcn:c2174c080a0e28a9aae34a79","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"呀——玩得真开心耶，训练员。","source_fingerprint":"fead768f5325c96350c1a419dcece927df1e759572114bcb1161c6b58dffe9d8","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1020","2032"],"target_text":"A—— chơi vui thật đấy, Trainer.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":78,"uid":"zhcn:3747f806cb348a1625fbf901","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"嗯——我想想——\r\n如果只是一点点的话，\r\n也可以对我抱有期待哦——？","source_fingerprint":"8c1da81d0615940607fc1d3ea61185fbf5c8dbaac2a97eca26d8e59f17f8177b","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1020","2033"],"target_text":"Ừm—— để mình nghĩ——\r\nNếu chỉ một chút thôi,\r\ncậu cũng có thể kỳ vọng vào mình đấy——?","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":79,"uid":"zhcn:82ce655ddd2c1a5c138e7d84","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"我早就都已经准备好咯。\r\n那我们就来去钓大鱼吧——！","source_fingerprint":"64f4a8ca2fde3a5e3932f62adbbb825fba401709856ed8db6c6237d91cf12fde","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1020","2034"],"target_text":"Mình chuẩn bị xong từ lâu rồi.\r\nVậy chúng ta đi câu cá lớn thôi——!","reviewed":true}]}